    },
    "Followed authors are visible if you have switched on Magazine Notifications.": {
        "de-CH": "Gefolgte Autoren sind sichtbar, wenn du Magazinmitteilungen eingeschaltet hast. ",
        "en-US": "Switch on magazine notifications to see the authors you follow.",
