    "It can take up to 24 hours before new [0] are displayed": {
        "de-CH": "Beachte, dass es bis zu 24 Stunden dauern kann, bis neue [0] angezeigt werden.",
        "en-US": "Please note that it can take up to 24 hours for new [0] to be displayed.",
