    "Second Hand Meta Description": {
        "de-CH": "Entdecke unser Secondhand Sortiment – finde attraktive Angebote neuwertig, gebraucht und geprüft. Top Service & Beratung. Schnelle Lieferung. Starke Community.",
        "en-US": "Discover our secondhand range and find attractive offers – as good as new, used and tested. Great service and advice. Fast delivery. Strong community.",
        "fr-CH": "Découvrez nos articles d'occasion ; trouvez des produits comme neufs, utilisés et testés. Service et conseil excellents. Livraison rapide. Communauté active.",
        "it-CH": "Scopri la nostra gamma di prodotti di seconda mano – trova offerte interessanti come nuove, usate e testate. Servizio e consulenza eccellenti. Consegna veloce. Community attiva.",
        "nl-NL": "Ontdek ons tweedehands assortiment en vind aantrekkelijke aanbiedingen - zo goed als nieuw, gebruikt en getest. Geweldige service en advies. Snelle levering. Sterke gemeenschap."
    },
