        "it-CH": "Acquistare di seconda mano [0]",
        "nl-NL": "Tweedehands kopen [0]"
    },
    "Second Hand [0] Meta Description": {
        "de-CH": "Gebraucht kaufen [0] – entdecke jetzt unsere Secondhand Angebote und bestelle die Produkte einfach online. Top Service und Beratung. Schnelle Lieferung. Starke Community.",
        "en-US": "Buy secondhand [0] – discover our secondhand offers and simply order the products online. Great service and advice. Fast delivery. Strong community.",
        "fr-CH": "Acheter d'occasion ; découvrez nos offres d'occasion [0] et commandez facilement en ligne. Service et conseil excellents. Livraison rapide. Communauté active.",
