    "The delivery is delayed for reasons still unknown.": {
        "de-CH": "Die Lieferung verzögert sich aus noch unbekannten Gründen.",
        "en-US": "Your delivery has been delayed, but it's currently unclear why.",
        "fr-CH": "La livraison est retardée pour des raisons encore inconnues.",
        "it-CH": "La consegna è in ritardo per motivi ancora sconosciuti.",
        "nl-NL": "De levering is om nog onbekende redenen vertraagd."
    },
    "The delivery is on its way or has already arrived. You can check the status yourself.": {
        "de-CH": "Die Lieferung ist auf dem Weg oder bereits angekommen. Du kannst den Status selbst überprüfen.",
        "en-US": "Your delivery is either on its way or has already arrived. It's possible to check the status of your delivery yourself.",
        "fr-CH": "La livraison est en cours d'acheminement ou est déjà arrivée. Vous pouvez vérifier vous-même le statut de la livraison.",
        "it-CH": "La consegna è in arrivo o già arrivata. Puoi controllare personalmente lo stato della consegna.",
        "nl-NL": "De levering is onderweg of al aangekomen. Je kunt de status zelf controleren."
    },
    "The delivery will arrive at the service partner ([0]) until [1].": {
        "de-CH": "Die Lieferung wird beim Servicepartner ([0]) bis [1] ankommen.",
        "en-US": "Your order will arrive at the service provider ([0]) by [1]",
        "fr-CH": "La livraison arrivera chez le partenaire de service ([0]) à [1].",
        "it-CH": "La consegna arriverà al partner di servizio ([0]) entro [1]",
        "nl-NL": "De levering zal aankomen bij de servicepartner ([0]) tot [1]."
    },
    "The delivery will take 1 week longer.": {
        "de-CH": "Die Lieferung dauert 1 Woche länger.",
        "en-US": "Delivery will take an extra week.",
        "fr-CH": "La livraison est retardée d'une semaine.",
        "it-CH": "La consegna richiede una settimana in più.",
        "nl-NL": "De levering duurt 1 week langer."
    },
    "The delivery will take 1–2 days longer.": {
        "de-CH": "Die Lieferung dauert 1–2 Tage länger",
        "en-US": "Delivery will take an extra 1–2 days.",
        "fr-CH": "La livraison est retardée d’un à deux jours.",
        "it-CH": "La consegna richiede 1-2 giorni in più",
        "nl-NL": "De levering duurt 1-2 dagen langer."
    },
    "The digital product has been generated and can be downloaded.": {
        "de-CH": "Der Download-Link wurde generiert und das Produkt kann heruntergeladen werden.",
        "en-US": "A download link has been generated. You can now download the product.",
        "fr-CH": "Le lien de téléchargement a été généré et le produit peut être téléchargé.",
        "it-CH": "Il link per il download è stato generato. Ora puoi scaricare il prodotto.",
        "nl-NL": "De downloadlink is gegenereerd en het product kan worden gedownload."
    },
    "The displayed warranty periods are not assured. The definitive confirmation of the guarantee takes place when the product is returned to the manufacturer or its authorized service center. Errors and omissions excepted.": {
        "de-CH": "Die angegebenen Garantiezeiten sind nicht zugesichert. Die endgültige Bestätigung der Garantie erfolgt, wenn das Produkt an den Hersteller oder sein autorisiertes Servicezentrum zurückgegeben wird. Irrtümer und Auslassungen sind vorbehalten.",
        "en-US": "The displayed warranty periods are not assured. The definitive confirmation of the guarantee takes place when the product is returned to the manufacturer or its authorized service center. Errors and omissions excepted.",
        "fr-CH": "Les périodes de garantie affichées ne sont pas garanties. La confirmation définitive de la garantie a lieu lorsque le produit est retourné au fabricant ou à son centre de service agréé. Sous réserve d'erreurs et d'omissions.",
        "it-CH": "I periodi di garanzia indicati non sono assicurati. La conferma definitiva della garanzia avviene quando il prodotto viene restituito al produttore o al suo centro di assistenza autorizzato. Salvo errori e omissioni.",
        "nl-NL": "De weergegeven garantietermijnen zijn niet gegarandeerd. De definitieve bevestiging van de garantie vindt plaats wanneer het product naar de fabrikant of zijn erkend servicecentrum wordt teruggestuurd. Fouten en omissies voorbehouden."
    },
    "The e-mail address you entered is invalid. Please check the entered e-mail.": {
        "de-CH": "Die E-Mail Adresse ist ungültig. Bitte überprüfe deine Eingabe.",
        "en-US": "The e-mail address you entered is invalid. Please check it.",
        "fr-CH": "L'adresse e-mail saisie n'est pas valide. Veuillez la vérifier.",
        "it-CH": "L'indirizzo e-mail inserito non è valido. Si prega di controllare.",
        "nl-NL": "Het ingevoerde e-mailadres is ongeldig. Controleer het alsjeblieft."
    },
    "The email address entered is invalid. Please check and try again.": {
        "de-CH": "Die eingegebene E-Mail-Adresse ist ungültig. Bitte überprüfe sie und versuche es erneut.",
        "en-US": "The e-mail address you’ve entered is invalid. Please double-check it and try again.",
        "fr-CH": "L’e-mail indiqué n’est pas valide. Veuillez vérifier et réessayer.",
        "it-CH": "L'indirizzo e-mail inserito non è valido. Controlla e riprova.",
        "nl-NL": "Het ingevoerde e-mailadres is ongeldig. Controleer en probeer het opnieuw."
    },
    "The entered code is invalid": {
        "de-CH": "Der eingegebene Code ist ungültig",
        "en-US": "This code is invalid",
        "fr-CH": "Le code saisi n'est pas valable",
        "it-CH": "Il codice inserito non è valido",
        "nl-NL": "Deze code is ongeldig"
    },
    "The entry must be at least 7 characters long.": {
        "de-CH": "Der Eintrag muss mindestens 7 Zeichen lang sein.",
        "en-US": "The entry must be at least 7 characters long.",
        "fr-CH": "L'entrée doit comporter au moins 7 caractères.",
        "it-CH": "La voce deve essere lunga almeno 7 caratteri.",
        "nl-NL": "De invoer moet minstens 7 tekens lang zijn."
    },
    "The entry must be at least 8 characters long.": {
        "de-CH": "Der Eintrag muss mindestens 8 Zeichen lang sein.",
        "en-US": "The entry must be at least 8 characters long.",
        "fr-CH": "L'entrée doit comporter au moins 8 caractères.",
        "it-CH": "La voce deve essere lunga almeno 8 caratteri.",
        "nl-NL": "De invoer moet minstens 8 tekens lang zijn."
    },
    "The free payment method by invoice is available to you once we've made enough positive payment experiences with you. Business customers can request a credit check to activate payment by invoice when registering or in their customer account. The invoice is sent to you by e-mail and is stored in your customer account.": {
        "de-CH": "Rechnungen stehen dir als gebührenfreie Zahlungsart zur Verfügung, sobald wir genügend positive Zahlungserfahrungen mit dir gemacht haben. Die Rechnung schicken wir dir per E-Mail. Du findest sie auch in deinem Kundenkonto.",
        "en-US": "You can pay by invoice free of charge once we’ve had enough positive payment history with you. We’ll send you the invoice by e-mail, and you'll also find it in your account.",
        "fr-CH": "Vous pouvez payer par facture sans frais une fois que nous avons assez d’expériences de paiement positives avec vous. Nous vous envoyons la facture par e-mail. Vous pouvez également la trouver dans votre compte client.",
        "it-CH": "Il pagamento tramite fattura sarà disponibile come metodo di pagamento gratuito non appena avremo acquisito sufficienti esperienze di pagamento positive con te. Ti invieremo la fattura via e-mail e potrai trovarla anche nel tuo conto cliente.",
        "nl-NL": "De gratis betaalmethode op factuur is voor jou beschikbaar zodra we genoeg positieve betaalervaringen met je hebben opgedaan. Zakelijke klanten kunnen bij registratie of in hun klantenaccount een kredietcontrole aanvragen om betaling op factuur te activeren. De factuur wordt je per e-mail toegestuurd en opgeslagen in je klantenaccount."
    },
    "The freight company will contact you if necessary.": {
        "de-CH": "Bei Bedarf kontaktiert dich die Speditionsfirma.",
        "en-US": "The forwarding service provider will contact you if required.",
        "fr-CH": "La société de transport vous contactera si nécessaire.",
        "it-CH": "Se necessario, ti contatterà la società di spedizione.",
        "nl-NL": "Het vrachtbedrijf zal contact met je opnemen als dat nodig is."
    },
    "The freight will be delivered on [0]": {
        "de-CH": "Die Lieferung durch die Spedition erfolgt am [0].",
        "en-US": "The forwarding service provider will deliver your order on [0].",
        "fr-CH": "Votre commande sera livrée par l’entreprise de transport le [0].",
        "it-CH": "La consegna tramite l'azienda di spedizione avverrà [0].",
        "nl-NL": "De expediteur levert je bestelling af op [0]."
    },
    "The goods are shipped as soon as we receive your payment.": {
