        "en-US": "The goods are shipped as soon as we receive your payment.",
        "fr-CH": "L’expédition a lieu après réception du paiement.",
        "it-CH": "La spedizione avviene dopo la ricezione del pagamento.",
        "nl-NL": "De goederen worden verzonden zodra we je betaling hebben ontvangen."
