    "You are not yet of age, so your payment will always go through the account administrator. As soon as you have reached the age of 18, you can set up a repayment account yourself.": {
        "de-CH": "Du bist noch nicht volljährig, daher läuft deine Bezahlung immer über den Kontoverwalter. Sobald du dein 18. Lebensjahr erreicht hast, kannst du selbst ein Rückzahlungskonto hinterlegen.",
        "en-US": "You are not yet of age, so your payment will always go through the account administrator. As soon as you have reached the age of 18, you can set up a repayment account yourself.",
        "fr-CH": "Tu n’as pas encore atteint l’âge de la majorité, c’est pourquoi ton paiement passe toujours par le gestionnaire de compte. Dès que tu auras atteint l’âge de 18 ans, tu pourras toi-même déposer un compte de remboursement.",
        "it-CH": "Non siete ancora maggiorenni, quindi il pagamento avverrà sempre tramite l’amministratore del conto. Non appena avrete compiuto 18 anni, potrete creare da soli un conto di rimborso.",
        "nl-NL": "Je bent nog niet meerderjarig, dus je betaling gaat altijd via de accountbeheerder. Zodra je 18 jaar bent, kun je zelf een afbetalingsrekening aanmaken."
    },
    "You are too young to order the following products, please remove them from your shopping cart in order to proceed: [0]": {
