        "nl-NL": "Je zaak is geannuleerd"
    },
    "Your case has been processed and solved by our merchant.": {
        "de-CH": "Dein Fall wurde von unserem Marktplatzhändler bearbeitet und gelöst.",
        "en-US": "Your case has been handled and resolved by our merchant.",
        "fr-CH": "Votre cas a été traité et résolu par notre marchand.",
        "it-CH": "Il tuo caso è stato elaborato e risolto dal nostro commerciante marketplace.",
        "nl-NL": "Uw zaak is behandeld en opgelost door onze handelaar."
    },
    "Your case has been resolved. Thank you for your patience and understanding. If you have any further concerns, please contact us.": {
        "de-CH": "Dein Fall wurde gelöst. Wir danken dir für deine Geduld und dein Verständnis. Solltest du weitere Anliegen haben, kontaktiere uns bitte.",
        "en-US": "Your case has been resolved. Thank you for your patience and understanding. If you need anything else, please don’t hesitate to get in touch.",
        "fr-CH": "Votre cas a été résolu. Nous vous remercions de votre patience et de votre compréhension. Si vous avez d’autres questions, n’hésitez pas à nous contacter.",
        "it-CH": "Il tuo caso è stato risolto. Grazie per la tua pazienza e comprensione. Se hai altri dubbi, contattaci.",
        "nl-NL": "Je zaak is opgelost. Bedankt voor je geduld en begrip. Als je nog vragen hebt, neem dan contact met ons op."
    },
    "Your case was handled by our merchant and resolved with a credit note.": {
